  "comment": "One of needs that may arise is the setting of a conference room at anytime during operating VoIP. For this purpose, it is not necessary for us to change the content of extensions.conf file. However we need to set up a conference that its general context in the extensions.conf file and meetme.conf: ;meetme.conf [rooms] ;general-purpose conference room conf =&gt; 3500,1234 ;extensions.conf ;generic",
